se Of The Legend - La nascita della leggenda","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"黄飞鸿之英雄有梦","overview":{"value":"Cina,1868. Per anni, il temibile boss della Tigre Nera, Lei Gong, ha cercato di liberarsi del leader del Mare del Nord. Una delle sue ultime reclute è Fei, un combattente senza paura che riesce a prendere la testa del leader del Mare del Nord dopo una feroce lotta. Proprio ora che Lei Gong crede di avere il controllo totale del porto, una nuova banda chiamata Orfani sale al potere guidata dall'amico d'infanzia di Fei, Huo....","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2014-11-20","status":"Released","rating":6.353,"ratingCount":231,"genres":["Dramma","Azione"],"countries":["Hong Kong","China"],"facts":{"Runtime":"131m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":126778,"name":"Eddie Peng","role":"Fei","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ZTpN3lXCyHsC02fgJdO9RqgYwt.jpg"},{"id":150899,"name":"AngelaBaby","role":"Orchid","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uYPkl2zs09xQ37yDkQaQwcXL5vu.jpg"},{"id":62410,"name":"Sammo Hung Kam-bo","role":"Master Lui","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AsB9uRDQWdIbFGnkICEl8I2gDWn.jpg"},{"id":56861,"name":"Tony Leung Ka-fai","role":"Fei's Father","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sPDShFDtDx1pMNwHEx14o4WHrEH.jpg"},{"id":1094210,"name":"Jing Boran","role":"Fiery","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vsXA4vbmlYDUmAAUuLBYQUUcMcF.jpg"},{"id":126807,"name":"Wong Cho-Lam","role":"Bigtooth","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/OtRzs4VUqcLlIJncm6SZ3UeI2d.jpg"},{"id":1183808,"name":"Max Zhang","role":"Wu Long","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vGJ0Jox8VCKpX4e6COT6KPYYeHJ.jpg"},{"id":1613707,"name":"Feng Jiayi","role":"Northevil","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yM7TiNde5uyAI0JvNFAbh94qgYa.jpg"},{"id":543159,"name":"Wang Luodan","role":"Chun","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/coSon6ItOshT7XjEC6odW8PXa1A.jpg"},{"id":17385,"name":"Qin Junjie","role":"Foon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iYdwWhvd4QuipsNkeB3XzFa27jo.jpg"},{"id":57748,"name":"Byron Mann","role":"Blackcrow","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lJXes5cQU2a3x5V4auFV4CFyrYB.jpg"},{"id":1624254,"name":"Gao Taiyu","role":"Wing","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xuSFUZ49bcKp0qsf7OJMKqOYKnY.jpg"},{"id":1570777,"name":"Julius Brian Siswojo","role":"Old Snake","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lOnmgpHe3T9Mmyo2WVX1NokExHQ.jpg"},{"id":1183231,"name":"Phat Chan","role":"Fat","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kb0QncjZKpX8Aq8un9pJLL8vTnR.jpg"},{"id":126083,"name":"Jiang Zhongwei","role":"Smiley","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyKZzSCVT5R1J1Enqm3ePqWibeQ.jpg"},{"id":1255141,"name":"Lo Pei-an","role":"Monk Fakhong","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AnJ3fV84bepsdk8jGlYICjtoSZ9.jpg"},{"id":224927,"name":"Chen Zhihui","role":"North Sea Gang master","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/13dhV4a6z90A0HH7MGgsNr7YFsy.jpg"},{"id":1624255,"name":"Fan Kuang-yao","role":"Blind Storyteller","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8QDtCeDZ8euXAaVPWIUbw61otT1.jpg"},{"id":1379951,"name":"Miroslav Karel","role":"Slave Boss"},{"id":52905,"name":"Mike Leeder","role":"Slave Boss","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lJXCbG1Fjn84GdKQnNNxL89Ww1L.jpg"},{"id":4842158,"name":"Keung Siu-Leung","role":"Chinese Boss"},{"id":4842162,"name":"Liang Lele","role":"Little Fei"},{"id":4842164,"name":"Yuan Mengyu","role":"Little Fiery"},{"id":2098578,"name":"Hu Shun'er","role":"Little Chun","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ncQVOa8BVhvMhcUioT3JJh1gy5z.jpg"},{"id":3709707,"name":"Zhang Zimu","role":"Little Hua","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ckTZ7YR0ebf27f8Ak3nQQwpk7F0.jpg"},{"id":3697653,"name":"Zhang Ying","role":"Pipa Player"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Rise Of The Legend - La nascita della leggenda","overview":"Cina,1868. Per anni, il temibile boss della Tigre Nera, Lei Gong, ha cercato di liberarsi del leader del Mare del Nord. Una delle sue ultime reclute è Fei, un combattente senza paura che riesce a prendere la testa del leader del Mare del Nord dopo una feroce lotta. Proprio ora che Lei Gong crede di avere il controllo totale del porto, una nuova banda chiamata Orfani sale al potere guidata dall'amico d'infanzia di Fei, Huo...."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Rise of the Legend","overview":"In 1868 during the late Qing Dynasty, rampant corruption on the Imperial Court inflicts much suffering in people's lives. For years, the Black Tiger’s fearsome boss Lei Gong has been trying to get rid of the leader of the Northern Sea. One of his latest recruits is Fei, a fearless fighter who takes the Northern Sea leader’s head after a fierce fight. Just as Lei Gong believes he has total control of the port, a new gang called the Orphans rises in power. Led by Fei’s childhood friend Huo, the Orphans are out to eliminate all the criminal power from the port…"},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"黄飞鸿之英雄有梦","overview":"故事发生在1886年清末的广州黄埔。满清腐败，天下大乱，黑虎帮与北海帮两大恶势力横行港口，欺压贫苦百姓。武师黄麒英（梁家辉 饰）携子黄飞鸿（彭于晏 饰）行走江湖，试图匡扶正义，却因此遭奸人忌恨，被纵火烧死。黄飞鸿与同伴赤火（井柏然 饰）被高僧所救，于深山苦练武艺与心性。\r 学成下山后，两人分头行动：赤火成为孤儿帮领袖，暗中积聚力量；黄飞鸿则为毁灭黑虎帮，卧底加入其中。他凭借过人身手，替黑虎帮铲除北海帮，立下大功，深受首领雷公（洪金宝 饰）赏识，被收为义子。\r 然而，黑虎帮不仅贩卖鸦片、逼良为娼，更与洋行勾结，进行人口贩卖。黄飞鸿目睹种种罪恶，内心备受煎熬。为从内部瓦解黑帮，他巧妙设计，令雷公的其他义子自相残杀，并与外部的赤火里应外合，誓要铲除雷公，拯救黄埔百姓于水火。\r 在最终的生死决战中，赤火为信念牺牲。黄飞鸿背负着父仇与兄弟的遗志，以无畏的勇气和武学智慧，向雷公发起终极挑战，誓要终结黑虎帮的暴政，成就一段属于他的英雄传奇。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jY0d1EZz9bkbQ13hZJO0abxRJ5h.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jY0d1EZz9bkbQ13hZJO0abxRJ5h.png","language":"en","width":1599,"height":299},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oPn3td3jZriKW1tBiUG0tQJtmZ2.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oPn3td3jZriKW1tBiUG0tQJtmZ2.p